The EU Cyber Resilience Act (CRA) sets obligations to importers when making products available on the EU market.

== How to decide if this secure development task is applicable

This task is required, if the product or the customer deliveries based on the product include placing other products on the EU market as an importer. In these cases, the importer responsibilities from EU CRA must be adhered to.

An importer places on the EU market a product of a manufacturer that is from outside the European Union.

== How to implement

Create a review of imported products, and follow the instructions in the templates.

== How to review

Check that a review of imported products has been conducted as applicable, and that the reviews are up to date.

